{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"cce15cc7fd65c9f16227e0f34f3b0514633bfb9ef883e0936d6560885eb025fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["闪、含、雅弗的后代"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["挪亚的儿子闪、含、雅弗的后代记在下面。洪水以后，他们都生了儿子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["雅弗的儿子是歌篾、玛各、玛代、雅完、土巴、米设、提拉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["歌篾的儿子是亚实基拿、利法、陀迦玛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["雅完的儿子是以利沙、他施、基提、多单。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["这些人的后裔将各国的地土、海岛分开居住，各随各的方言、宗族立国。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["含的儿子是古实、麦西、弗、迦南。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["古实的儿子是西巴、哈腓拉、撒弗他、拉玛、撒弗提迦。拉玛的儿子是示巴、底但。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["古实又生宁录，他为世上英雄之首。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他在耶和华面前是个英勇的猎户，所以俗语说：「像宁录在耶和华面前是个英勇的猎户。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他国的起头是巴别、以力、亚甲、甲尼，都在示拿地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他从那地出来往亚述去，建造尼尼微、利河伯、迦拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["和尼尼微、迦拉中间的利鲜，这就是那大城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["麦西生路低人、亚拿米人、利哈比人、拿弗土希人、"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["帕斯鲁细人、迦斯路希人、迦斐托人；从迦斐托出来的有非利士人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["迦南生长子西顿，又生赫"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["和耶布斯人、亚摩利人、革迦撒人、"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["希未人、亚基人、西尼人、"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["亚瓦底人、洗玛利人、哈马人，后来迦南的诸族分散了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["迦南的境界是从西顿向基拉耳的路上，直到迦萨，又向所多玛、蛾摩拉、押玛、洗扁的路上，直到拉沙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["这就是含的后裔，各随他们的宗族、方言，所住的地土、邦国。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["雅弗的哥哥闪，是希伯子孙之祖，他也生了儿子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["闪的儿子是以拦、亚述、亚法撒、路德、亚兰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["亚兰的儿子是乌斯、户勒、基帖、玛施。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["亚法撒生沙拉；沙拉生希伯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["希伯生了两个儿子，一个名叫法勒",{"noteId":3},"，因为那时人就分地居住；法勒的兄弟名叫约坍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["约坍生亚摩答、沙列、哈萨玛非、耶拉、"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["哈多兰、乌萨、德拉、"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["俄巴路、亚比玛利、示巴、"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["阿斐、哈腓拉、约巴，这都是约坍的儿子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["他们所住的地方是从米沙直到西发东边的山。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["这就是闪的子孙，各随他们的宗族、方言，所住的地土、邦国。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["这些都是挪亚三个儿子的宗族，各随他们的支派立国。洪水以后，他们在地上分为邦国。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"就是分的意思","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":25}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}